            <ArticleTitle>[A tube scalpel for myocardial revascularization in patients with ischemic heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>44-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper describes a tube scalpel for fulfilling the basic stage of left ventricular myocardial tunneling. It shows great advantages of the proposed instrument over its prototype. The developed multifunctional tunnel-cutting scalpel is recommended for cardiac surgeons to use in their practice to enhance the efficiency and safety of left ventricular myocardial tunneling.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
